cell just to the south of the hallway "north"
from the treasure zoo outer door. NetHack,
asked, confirmed what I was seeing:

} a weapon (runed arrow, embedded in a wall)

Huh? Has someone given the fletcher or knapper
a potion of Oil of Extra Sharpness?

